						<memberName>Justicar</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Prime Decider</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Prime Decider</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Cody Jennings created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Jennings broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that he could. Jennings carried a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;sniper rifle&lt;/color&gt; named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ideo- Rifle&lt;/color&gt; with him everywhere to remind people to live an ethical life.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Oppressed by distant rulers who demanded uniform obedience from the people, Cody Jennings created a rebel movement that smashed the state and built a new land of liberty in its place. Jennings broke every social rule the oppressors tried to enforce, just to show that he could. Jennings carried a %%relic0_thingDef_label%% named %%relic0_name%% with him everywhere to remind people to live an ethical life.</descriptionTemplate>
