						<name>Rhydellian Theonomy</name>
						<adjective>Theonomic</adjective>
						<memberName>Theonomist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Christ's Ruler</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Christ's Ruler</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; created all of nature, and gave it to man as a gift, to serve man and his purposes forever. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt;. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% created all of nature, and gave it to man as a gift, to serve man and his purposes forever. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by %%deity0_name%%. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>SpikeyC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Sapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.136, 0.485, 0.953, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginChristian</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>FleshPurity</li>
							<li>HumanPrimacy</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
