						<description>Archotechs are humanity's children and its judges. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. Some day, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</description>
